```
Mockito.verify(foo, atLeastOnce()).getProperty(anyString());
Mockito.verify(foo, atLeastOnce()).getProperty(anyString(), anyString());

```

Or, if you want to verify that the method was called at least once, and the same method was called:

```
Mockito.verify(foo, atLeastOnce()).getProperty(anyString());
Mockito.verify(foo, atLeastOnce()).getProperty(anyString(), anyString());

```

Or, if you want to verify that the method was called at least once, and the same method was called, and the same argument was passed:

```
Mockito.verify(foo, atLeastOnce()).getProperty(anyString(), anyString());

