You annotate one of your entities with 

```
@NamedEntityGraph(
  name = "report-eg",
  attributeNodes = {
    @NamedAttributeNode("foo"),
    @NamedAttributeNode(value = "bar", subgraph = "bar-eg"),
  },
  subgraphs = {
